    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven visual novel blending romantic fairy tales, surreal fantasy, and yuri themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;What are you searching for?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon waking, she finds herself lost in a surreal fairy-tale world.<br>As Alice, she encounters a cast of bizarre characters: factions fighting over names, a bodiless witch, a gardener cultivating world-destroying plants, a lonely collector obsessed with names, and a manager who only speaks when offered alcohol.<br>Everything feels strangely familiar yet utterly alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Alice, I\u2019ll always stay by your side. Whatever you wish for, I\u2019ll make it come true.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl with long purple hair, Zixuan, stands by her, giving her the courage to face this strange world.<br>To return to the real world, the two of them support each other and push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will they discover in this world?<br>What awaits them in the gap between fairy tale and reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Alice, remember this: as you wander through this strange fairy-tale world, never doubt your own common sense. Once you start questioning yourself, you won\u2019t be able to return to reality.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zixuan\u2019s warning becomes Alice\u2019s only hope in this twisted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to see in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Illustration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely SD illustrations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character voice support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique performances</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a narrative-driven visual novel blending romantic fairy tales, surreal fantasy, and yuri themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;What are you searching for?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon waking, she finds herself lost in a surreal fairy-tale world.<br>As Alice, she encounters a cast of bizarre characters: factions fighting over names, a bodiless witch, a gardener cultivating world-destroying plants, a lonely collector obsessed with names, and a manager who only speaks when offered alcohol.<br>Everything feels strangely familiar yet utterly alien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Alice, I\u2019ll always stay by your side. Whatever you wish for, I\u2019ll make it come true.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl with long purple hair, Zixuan, stands by her, giving her the courage to face this strange world.<br>To return to the real world, the two of them support each other and push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will they discover in this world?<br>What awaits them in the gap between fairy tale and reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Alice, remember this: as you wander through this strange fairy-tale world, never doubt your own common sense. Once you start questioning yourself, you won\u2019t be able to return to reality.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zixuan\u2019s warning becomes Alice\u2019s only hope in this twisted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to see in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Illustration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovely SD illustrations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character voice support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique performances</p></li></ul>",
